[00:00.00][by:陈子一枚]
[00:28.08]Imagine if the life that you thought you shared
[00:28.08]想象你与他人共度的时光
[00:33.17]Wasn’t really there
[00:33.17]不是真实存在的
[00:36.98]It was made up in your mind
[00:36.98]它由你的思绪组成
[00:38.90]Could be anyone/anywhere
[00:38.90]可以是任何人或任何地点
[00:43.49]'Cause you'd been living in a world
[00:43.49]因为你生话在
[00:46.80]Of your own design, undermined
[00:46.80]一个你自己幻想的破败的世界
[00:52.49]In another place
[00:52.49]在另一个地方
[00:54.51]Other space in time
[00:54.51]在另一个时间
[01:01.03]As the dust clears and it all starts to disappear
[01:01.03]混沌变得清晰，逐渐消失
[01:08.54]It may get harder 'cause you just restarted
[01:08.54]你需要重新开始，这会很难
[01:16.70]And wherever you are, land on another stone
[01:16.70]无论你在哪，都要踏足另一片天地
[01:23.50]It may get harder 'cause you just restarted
[01:23.50]你需要重新开始，这会很难
[02:05.32]Imagine if the friend that you thought you knew
[02:05.32]想象你的朋友
[02:08.72]Wasn't really true
[02:08.72]都不是真实的
[02:12.08]It just existed in your head
[02:12.08]它只存在于你的脑海
[02:14.06]The reflection used wasn't you
[02:14.06]这不是真实的你
[02:20.01]Completely unaware
[02:20.01]一切都完全不明了
[02:22.05]Could be anywhere/anytime
[02:22.05]可以是任何时空
[02:27.88]'Cause there was shift
[02:27.88]有些东西正在改变
[02:29.37]In the paradigm
[02:29.37]在你的潜意识中
[02:35.40]As the dust clears and it all starts to disappear
[02:35.40]混沌变得清晰，逐渐消失
[02:43.64]It may get harder 'cause you just restarted
[02:43.64]你需要重新开始，这会很难
[02:51.81]And wherever you are, land on another stone
[02:51.81]无论你在哪，都要踏足另一片天地
